ItemDisplay[ID (CHSK54>0) FCR>0 STAFF LVLREQ<31]: %ORANGE%* * *   %NAME% %ORANGE%[LLD]   * * *{%RED%***   %PURPLE%LLD FCR Teleport Charges Staff%RED%   ***}  // Teleport charges FCR
